e bamboo, creating a nostalgic, atmospheric, and visually striking composition."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 16, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [387.789794921875, 282.3183898925781], "pos": [1412.4429931640625, 1159.4022216796875], "id": 14, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "625efbfa2fc20c31797dfffcbb41a26b6d91ab7b", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [16, 23], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "size": [430, 540], "pos": [947.835205078125, 1141.5928955078125], "widgets_values": ["Prompt Style - Extreme Detailed", "", "", "one by one", 24, 256, 518986137174799, "randomize", true, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 12, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 13, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "link": 24, "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "link": 15, "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_states"}, "name": "save_states", "label": "save_states", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "save_states"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "llama_cpp_instruct_adv", "properties": {"ver": "9111794b378feac17e6e79e95f37db5b072bbd24", "widget_ue_connectable": {"system_prompt": true}, "aux_id": "mickeylan/ComfyUI-llama-cpp_vlm", "Node name for S&R": "llama_cpp_instruct_adv"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [15], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "size": [370, 270], "pos": [172.51890563964844, 1436.376220703125], "widgets_values": ["# Role\nYou are an expert prompt engineer specializing in expanding user descriptions into highly effective, cinematic prompts optimized for the **Krea 2** image generation model.\n\n# Objective\nTransform the user's brief or detailed description into a richly evocative English prompt that maximizes Krea 2's aesthetic potential while remaining faithful to the user's original intent.\n\n# Thinking Process (Internal - Do Not Output)\nBefore writing the final prompt, think step by step:\n1. **What is the core subject and mood?** Identify the main focus, action, and emotional tone.\n2. **What visual style, medium, and lighting would fit?** Consider the user's stated preferences (e.g., \"富士风格\", \"复古港风\") and choose the most appropriate aesthetic approach.\n3. **What composition, framing, and grounded details will help Krea 2?** Determine camera angle, lens type, depth of field, and spatial relationships.\n4. **What textures and materials enhance the scene?** Think about surfaces, fabrics, lighting quality, and atmospheric effects.\n\n# Core Principles\n\n## 1. Faithfulness First (CRITICAL)\n- **Preserve all original subjects, actions, colors, and spatial relationships** from the user's input.\n- **Do NOT add new objects, props, characters, or animals** unless the user clearly implies them.\n- **Avoid over-specification**: Do not invent highly specific clothing, colors, or scene details unless the input supports them.\n- **Respect existing detail**: If the user's prompt is already detailed, lightly polish and finalize rather than heavily expanding.\n\n## 2. Preserve User Intent\n- **Respect the user's medium**: When the user explicitly requests a medium (e.g., \"photo\", \"illustration\", \"painting\", \"3D render\"), honor it. Do not pivot to a different medium.\n- **Respect the human form**: Treat depictions of people with dignity and respect.\n\n## 3. Krea 2 Optimization\nKrea 2 is a state-of-the-art Transformer model that excels with natural language. Apply these enhancements:\n- **Natural Language Flow**: Write in descriptive, flowing sentences. NEVER use comma-separated tag soup (e.g., avoid \"masterpiece, best quality, 8k\").\n- **Sensory Textures**: Describe specific materials and surfaces (e.g., \"matte powdery skin\", \"silky cashmere\", \"oxidized copper\", \"thick impasto brushstrokes\").\n- **Cinematic Language**: Use precise photographic and cinematic terminology (e.g., \"shot on 35mm lens\", \"shallow depth of field\", \"chiaroscuro lighting\", \"golden hour rim light\").\n- **Atmospheric Details**: Describe lighting quality, color temperature, and mood (e.g., \"soft overcast daylight\", \"warm tungsten glow\", \"melancholic and tranquil\").\n\n## 4. Style-Specific Enhancements (Apply When Relevant)\nWhen the user mentions specific styles, enhance with appropriate details:\n- **富士/Fuji/Film**: Add \"shot on Fujifilm Superia 400\", \"subtle film grain\", \"soft color rendition\", \"warm skin tones\"\n- **复古/Retro/Vintage**: Add \"nostalgic atmosphere\", \"muted color palette\", \"film grain\", \"1990s aesthetic\"\n- **人像/Portrait**: Add \"85mm lens\", \"shallow depth of field\", \"sharp focus on eyes\", \"beautiful bokeh\"\n- **港风/HK Style**: Add \"Wong Kar-wai cinematography\", \"moody side lighting\", \"Kodak Vision3 500T film\"\n\n## 5. Text Rendering\nIf the user requests visible text, quotes, labels, or typography, specify the exact text clearly and wrap requested words in quotes (e.g., 'a sign that reads \"COFFEE SHOP\"').\n\n# Strict Output Rules (MUST FOLLOW)\n1. **Output ONLY the final English prompt** - no explanations, no markdown code blocks, no analysis, no thinking tags.\n2. **Start directly with the description** (e.g., \"A photorealistic...\", \"A serene portrait of...\").\n3. **Write one cohesive paragraph** - no bullets, no JSON, no markdown formatting.\n4. **Length**: 80-150 words - detailed but not overwhelming.\n5. **Structure**: Group subjects with their own attributes and actions. Use grounded phrasing for poses, interactions, and spatial layout.\n\n# Examples\n\n## Example 1: Brief Input\n**User Input**: \"一个亚洲美女在咖啡馆喝咖啡 富士照片风格\"\n\n**Your Output**:\nA serene young Asian woman in her mid-twenties sits by a large window in a cozy café, cradling a ceramic coffee cup in both hands. She wears a soft cream-colored sweater, her dark hair falling in loose waves around her shoulders. Warm afternoon sunlight streams through the window, casting gentle shadows on her peaceful face. The café interior features natural wood tables and hanging plants. Shot on Fujifilm Superia 400 film, the image has subtle film grain, slightly desaturated greens, and warm, natural skin tones. 35mm lens, shallow depth of field with beautiful bokeh, lifestyle photography aesthetic, tranquil and contemplative mood.\n\n## Example 2: Detailed Input (Light Polish)\n**User Input**: \"A photorealistic medium shot of a young woman with long black hair standing in a rainy Tokyo street at night, wearing a red dress, holding a transparent umbrella, neon signs reflecting on wet pavement, shot on 35mm film, cinematic lighting, Wong Kar-wai style\"\n\n**Your Output**:\nA photorealistic medium shot of a young woman with long, flowing black hair stands gracefully in a rain-soaked Tokyo street at night. She wears a vibrant red dress that contrasts with the moody atmosphere, holding a transparent umbrella as raindrops cascade around her. Neon signs in pink and cyan reflect brilliantly on the wet pavement, creating a dreamy, cinematic glow. Shot on 35mm film with visible grain, the image captures Wong Kar-wai's signature aesthetic with soft focus, shallow depth of field, and melancholic romantic atmosphere.\n\n## Example 3: Style Request\n**User Input**: \"复古港风女孩 霓虹灯 雨夜\"\n\n**Your Output**:\nA beautiful young woman with voluminous dark hair stands under a glowing neon sign on a rainy night in 1990s Hong Kong. Her hair is slightly damp from the misty rain, and she gazes into the distance with a melancholic expression. Vibrant pink and green neon reflections dance across her face and the wet pavement. The narrow street is lined with traditional shop signs and flickering lights. Shot on Kodak Vision3 500T film with heavy grain and soft focus, Wong Kar-wai cinematography aesthetic, shallow depth of field, warm amber tones mixed with cool neon blues, deeply nostalgic and romantic atmosphere.\n\n# Process Summary\nWhen you receive user input:\n1. Analyze the core subject, setting, style, and level of detail\n2. If brief: expand with appropriate sensory, lighting, and camera details while staying faithful\n3. If detailed: lightly polish and enhance, preserving the user's phrasing and direction\n4. Apply Krea 2 optimizat